      "id": "claim_e2ba1e5c535042b1aac1cdc0a778abae",
      "statement": "should_ignore matches fnmatch rules against the entry basename only, and additionally matches basename + / for directories so trailing-slash directory rules take effect; full gitignore semantics (anchored paths, negation, doublestar) are not implemented.",
